    "emitting-contract-rule",
    "contract-event"
  ],
  "why": "Any contract can emit an event with topics [transfer, from, to, \"USD:G\u2026\"]. Only the event's contractID says whose token it is; here it is the test emitter, not USD's contract, and no balance changes. A reader that keys movements on the event's asset string credits the victim with USD it never received.",
